  <p>Last updated: August 21, 2026</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>The Field &amp; Farm is a static website. We do not require accounts and we do not collect personal information through forms.</p>
  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand which pages are useful. If analytics are enabled, they are aggregated and do not identify individual visitors.
  </p>
