  <p>
    When you click an affiliate link, the affiliate program (such as Amazon Associates or a software vendor's program) may set cookies to attribute the referral. These cookies are set by the affiliate network, not by us.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be directed via the <a href="/about/">About</a> page.</p>
</BaseLayout>
